<!-- README.md, first paragraph: the list of heroes, after Thor ("or, if you are worthy, **Thor** ...") -->
En Sabah Nur, **Apocalypse**, a boss you beat to earn his Essence

<!-- README.md, section "Becoming a hero": one table row -->
| **Apocalypse** | Craft a **Capstone** (a Nether Star, five Gold Blocks, a Lapis Block) and Sneak + right-click it on sand by day with a Scarlet Witch or a Phoenix within 64 blocks to wake **En Sabah Nur**: a boss in a golden shield that stops everything but mind power, with sand, portals and the Four Horsemen. Every fighter who stayed a minute and hurt him or his shield gets the **Essence**; hold it for three seconds with no power to become **Apocalypse**: sand waves and entombing, levitation, a portal, a golden shield of your own and power bestowal (Sneak: a sandstorm). |

<!-- README.md, section "Controls": the key table of the hero -->
| Apocalypse | Sand Wave (Sneak: Entomb) | Levitation (toggle) | Portal | Shield (hold) | Power Bestowal (Sneak: Sandstorm) |

<!-- README.md, section "For server owners": the power list adds `apocalypse`; the boss commands -->
`apocalypse` joins the list of powers of `/enhanced power set`. `/enhanced boss start apocalypse [force]`, `/enhanced boss stop` and `/enhanced boss list` start, end and list boss fights; the options of the fight and the hero are in the sections `[apocalypse_shield]`, `[apocalypse_boss]` and `[apocalypse]` of the server config.
